    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_actions_archive">移到这条消息。<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Swipe up">%1$s</xliff:g>或<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Swipe down">%2$s</xliff:g>可浏览它的操作。<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Double-tap">%3$s</xliff:g>可执行听到的操作。执行“<xliff:g id="action" example="Archive">%4$s</xliff:g>”。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_actions_intro">有些项除了激活之外还有其他操作，例如消息的“归档”或“删除”。此类项获得焦点时，“操作”朗读控件可浏览这些操作。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_actions_title">操作</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_activate_button">移到“<xliff:g id="button" example="Ring the bell">%2$s</xliff:g>”。<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Double-tap">%1$s</xliff:g>即可激活它。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_activate_check_box">用同样的方法勾选“<xliff:g id="check_box" example="Extra cheese">%1$s</xliff:g>”。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_activate_hold">有些项在按住时会执行其他操作。移到“<xliff:g id="button" example="Details">%2$s</xliff:g>”。<xliff:g id="gesture" example="Double-tap and hold">%1$s</xliff:g>即可按住它。</string>
