    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_sliders_highest">将“<xliff:g id="slider" example="Brightness">%1$s</xliff:g>”设为百分之百，即最大值。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_sliders_intro">滑块获得焦点时，向上和向下滑动可更改它的值。</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_sliders_title">滑块</string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_step">第 <xliff:g id="number" example="1">%1$d</xliff:g> 步，共 <xliff:g id="count" example="2">%2$d</xliff:g> 步：<xliff:g id="instruction" example="Swipe right to move to the next item.">%3$s</xliff:g></string>
    <string name="sandfly_tutorial_story">沙蝇是生活在海滩、河岸和森林中的小型蝇类。它们在黎明和黄昏空气静止时最为活跃。只有雌性会叮人，因为它们需要血液来产卵。叮咬处会痒好几天，所以前往沙蝇出没地区的人会携带驱虫剂。沙蝇飞行能力很弱，即使是微风也能让它们远离。</string>
